<Paragraph><Strong>shopkeeper</Strong></Paragraph>
<H1>The work behind a simple customer question.</H1>
<Paragraph>“Can I change the size on my order?”</Paragraph>
<Paragraph>For a store owner, that can mean finding the order, checking stock, making a change, and writing back — all while the rest of the shop keeps moving.</Paragraph>
<Paragraph>That's the kind of work we're building Shopkeeper to help with. It brings the customer conversation and Shopify together, and asks for your approval when a decision needs you.</Paragraph>
<Paragraph>Shopkeeper is still in development. We're focused on making those everyday handoffs useful and dependable before opening early access.</Paragraph>
<Paragraph>Which customer request do you find yourself handling over and over? Hit reply — your answers help us decide what to build next.</Paragraph>
<Paragraph>Rajbir, founder of Shopkeeper</Paragraph>
<Divider />
